      "writtenOn": "2023-08-07T07:25:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Re Pierre:\n\nIf two devices are in the same IOMMU group, they should have the same iommu-group property in the (single) VM DTBO. And pvmfw can trigger an error unless both devices appear in the VM DT pointing to the same pvIOMMU.",
      "parentUuid": "1b7d9b9b_086b2931",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 190,
